WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to the Universal Player demo.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Turn captions on or off with the CC button.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Open Quality to step down or up through the HLS levels.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Open Share, then Copy embed code to grab an iframe snippet.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Press S, Q, [ or ] to try the new keyboard shortcuts.
